    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Scope of this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Saved Google/Meta run · captured 14 November 2026 · AI-assisted development · human-approved publication**\n\nThese panels read the validated Sequence 25 export. Scrapes are live; the research evidence is a saved snapshot. The cumulative S22–S25 logical run is counted once; other attempts are outside these totals. Earlier failed attempts remain in the event history.\n\n**12/12 verification covers code-rendered financial table values only.** It does not measure qualitative correctness, every number in prose, or independent held-out performance. Some critic sentence receipts remain incomplete."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Published notes",
      "description": "One final publication is recorded in imported evidence. This service never publishes notes.",
