      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Included:** saved provider usage, original token reservations, broker-observed tool counts and successful latency, critic rejection events, correction/error events, exact publication status, scoped financial table verification.\n\n**Not measured:** full live agent traces, failed-call latency, EDGAR cache-hit rate, unlogged operator reads, qualitative accuracy, independent held-out performance. LangSmith/Langfuse integration and the broader red-team evaluation remain separate work.\n\nRead the sanitized event timeline at [localhost:8085](http://localhost:8085/). It contains allowlisted metadata only; no prompts, note text, reviewer identity, model response cache or credentials."
      }
    },
