        "content": "The warning condition is **verified financial table share <98% with a positive denominator**.\n\nThe runner temporarily uses the separate `synthetic_alert_probe` dataset, observes firing at 97%, restores 100%, then disables the probe. No real note or source evidence is altered.\n\nAll real-data panels explicitly select `google_meta_sequence25`. Inspect alerts at [localhost:9090/alerts](http://localhost:9090/alerts). No external notification is sent."
      }
